      "text": "WHEREAS, the letting of contracts for public work or the purchase of supplies, material or equipment under public emergency conditions which in the public interest require immediate action which cannot await competitive bidding has been a subject of serious concern to the Mayor and the Comptroller of the City of New York, and",
